            "text": {
              "status": "generated",
              "div": "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><h3>Annotation</h3><table class=\"hl7__eu__lab__report\"><tr><th>Conclusion and Recommendations based on this report and previous findings known to us:</th></tr><tr><td>All hematological parameters are within normal limits except for a markedly elevated platelet distribution width, which may indicate increased platelet size variability, possibly due to platelet activation or a reactive process. No evidence of anemia, leukocytosis, or thrombocytopenia. Correlation with clinical context is recommended.</td></tr></table></div>"
